    "edit_note": "\u96fb\u67f1 (PLAN.md T1): a 14 m concrete distribution pole, 11.67 m above the ground (the rest is its \u6839\u5165\u308c, modelled below z 0 so a pole on a falling verge still reaches the ground). Origin = the axis at the ground, +X = the ROAD side, +Y along the road. Where the wires arrive is furniture.json `denchu_wires`: move an insulator and that table together. The lamp's bulb place is world.StreetLights HEAD_OFFSETS. Keep to MI_ConcreteSmooth / MI_Steel / MI_PaintYellow (+ MI_Light): one draw per material per chunk."
